msgstr "https: / / github.com / x-o-rrr-o / xorro-direct-wallet -payments-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — no third-party payment processor. Supports BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ and 200+ coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."
msgstr "Terima pembayaran cryptorecee langsung ke dompet Anda sendiri - tidak ada tiga puluh pihak pembayaran prosesor. Mendukung BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ dan 200 + koin / token dengan verifikasi rantai otomatis."

